---
/*
  Header.astro - Site Header Component
  Converted from: inc-header.php
  
  Changes:
  1. $siteurl → "/" (root path)
  2. $imagesurl → "/media/images/"
  3. $sitename → "runr"
  4. PHP captcha/CRM notice removed (not needed for static site)
  5. PHP commented-out code removed
  6. Form action changed (no PHP backend) - form preserved for future use
  7. Hidden fields with PHP $_GET removed (static site)
*/
---

